# The project's own brand wiring, written by `npm run test:graphic-design-api`
# and by `generate-skill.mjs`. Generated state, like `ai-helper/installed.json`:
# `resources.md` names whichever assets this checkout points at, and
# `graphic-design-api.json` carries a generation timestamp, so tracking either
# would make every run a diff. Root-anchored on purpose - the helper skill's own
# `references/` folder is tracked source.
/references/

# Local helper scripts for the machine they were written on - Illustrator
# .jsx/.js run by hand, one-off utilities, anything tied to a personal setup.
# They are not part of the build and are not meant to ship with the repo.
userScripts/

# The plugin manifests are tracked source. A global "ignore every dot-entry"
# rule would otherwise leave the marketplace and the plugin uncommittable,
# and an unpublished manifest is a plugin nobody can add.
!.claude-plugin/
!ai-helper/.claude-plugin/
